{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人張致恒（Steven）近日洗心革面、努力打工賺錢養家，但因過去累積的債務與「街數」未清，向身邊不少圈中好友及朋友借錢遲遲未還，頻頻成為娛樂圈與網民關注的焦點。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;今日（10日）適逢是其42歲生日，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.218581+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T03:31:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"eba771a72b824ef356cbb9e971bd3ec8c6d9653dae15970b14287ef633ad90d6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}